WEBVTT

00:00:02.687 --> 00:00:03.835
<v><b>Jessica:</b></v> Excuse me.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.259
Are they free?

00:00:05.642 --> 00:00:06.707
<v><b>Richard:</b></v> Yes, they are.

00:00:07.347 --> 00:00:08.254
Please sit down.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:09.370
<v><b>Jessica:</b></v> Thanks.

00:00:12.009 --> 00:00:13.998
I’m Jessica. Hi.

00:00:14.329 --> 00:00:15.730
<v><b>Jim:</b></v> And I’m Jim.

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:17.418
<v><b>Richard:</b></v> Are you American?

00:00:17.796 --> 00:00:18.939
<v><b>Jessica:</b></v> No, we aren’t.

00:00:19.411 --> 00:00:20.632
We’re from Canada.

00:00:20.897 --> 00:00:23.311
<v><b>Richard:</b></v> Oh, OK! We’re English.

00:00:23.661 --> 00:00:24.553
I’m Richard.

00:00:24.895 --> 00:00:25.976
<v><b>Rachel:</b></v> And I’m Rachel.

00:00:26.471 --> 00:00:27.550
<v><b>Jim:</b></v> Nice to meet you.